    "K_t": "Evidence:\n[1] Karatholuvu Chandrasekaran Sivasankaran (also known as KC Sivasankaran, Artist Sankar), (born 19 July 1924) is an Indian artist who primarily contributed to the Indian Language magazine, \"Chandamama\" (also known as \"Ambulimama\").\n[2] Khalid Legend Robinson (born February 11, 1998), known mononymously as Khalid, is an American singer and songwriter.\n[3] He was perhaps best known regionally as the artist behind \"A Portrait of A Distinguished Citizen,\" a weekly portrait feature that ran in the \"Idaho Statesman\" from 1963 to 1993.\n[4] American Teen is the debut studio album by American singer Khalid."
